    "title": "NightTalk",
    "description": "NightTalk provides an easy way to find and make new friends from all over the world. Feeling bored and unsure of how to spend time? Want to share your thoughts, feelings or just want to talk to someone? Want to make new friends but don' t know where to start? NightTalks the best app to meet new people and make new friends over live video chat\r\n\r\nNightTalks a 1-on-1 live online video chat app, which allows you to make friends from all over the world. With our advanced HD video technology, you can communicate with strangers like you are face to face anytime and from anywhere. It's a great way to get rid of your social phobia and understand different cultures! Chat with people and enjoy your time.",
